// input: after idr-simplify
// FILECHECK-OPTIONS: --implicit-check-not=@Main.iter(
// One copy of iter per static function argument: iter is partial, but its
// calls are not closed (n comes from stdin), so each is specialized on the
// closure it passes, whose label is the key. The original iter is dead
// and removed. Each copy computes with its own function, in either order
// (two copies with the same function would share one key, so they would
// be one copy).
// CHECK: func.func private @Main.iter$spec${{[0-9]+}}(
// CHECK: arith.{{addi|muli}}
// CHECK: func.func private @Main.iter$spec${{[0-9]+}}(
// CHECK: arith.{{addi|muli}}
